
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head page-head--art">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">For restaurants</span>
        <h1>Bookings answered, even in the Friday rush.</h1>
        <figure class="ph-art ph-art--phone" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/art/phone-restaurant.webp?v=2" alt="" width="600" height="1005" /></figure>
        <p class="lead">&ldquo;Table for 6 at 7?&rdquo;, &ldquo;are you open on Monday?&rdquo;, &ldquo;do you have vegan options?&rdquo;: answered from your own menu and diary while the kitchen is flat out.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-restaurants-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="live-demo?sample=restaurant" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large" data-track="cta-restaurants-demo">See it answer one</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="painTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Where the day goes</span><h2 id="painTitle">The messages that eat your day.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--3">
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg></span><h3>Calls and WhatsApps during service</h3><p>The phone rings at 19:30 and nobody can get to it. WhatsApps sit unread until close. Those bookings go to the place that answered.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m17 1 4 4-4 4"/><path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"/><path d="m7 23-4-4 4-4"/><path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"/></svg></span><h3>The same five questions</h3><p>Hours, parking, the menu, kids, vegan options. Typed again, every day.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="m17 8 5 5M22 8l-5 5"/></svg></span><h3>Empty tables you&rsquo;d booked</h3><p>A table of 8 that doesn&rsquo;t show on Saturday is a table you turned away twice.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="setTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What we&rsquo;d set up</span>
          <h2 id="setTitle">Answered mid-service. You stay in charge.</h2>
          <ul class="tick-list">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Replies from your menu, hours and booking rules; the safe ones you choose go out by themselves</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Normal table requests offered real times, even at 7pm on a Friday</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Functions and big tables flagged to the manager, with an instant holding reply so they don&rsquo;t book elsewhere</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>A reminder the afternoon before (&ldquo;Reply YES to keep your table&rdquo;), so cancellations free up the table</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Facebook, Instagram and Google messages answered; reviews thanked and complaints flagged to the manager the same night</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Optional: a website with the full menu and WhatsApp ordering</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem">It answers only from your own prices and rules. Anything it isn&rsquo;t sure about goes to a person.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="industry-demos">
          <a class="card card--link work-card reveal" href="live-demo?sample=restaurant">
            <div class="work-card__body">
              <div class="work-card__meta"><span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo</span><span class="tag tag--muted">Sample work, nothing is sent</span></div>
              <h3>A Friday of messages, answered</h3>
              <p>Tables, kids&rsquo; menus, corkage and a function for 40: answered from the menu and booking rules, with the function and a complaint passed to the manager.</p>
              <div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">Run it yourself</span></div>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a class="card card--link work-card reveal" href="live-demo?sample=reviews">
            <div class="work-card__body">
              <div class="work-card__meta"><span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo</span><span class="tag tag--muted">Sample work, nothing is sent</span></div>
              <h3>Your weekend reviews, sorted by Monday</h3>
              <p>Thank-yous drafted, an allergy complaint flagged, and slow Saturday service spotted as a pattern.</p>
              <div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">Run it yourself</span></div>
            </div>
