    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="priceTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span><h2 id="priceTitle">A fixed price before anything starts.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--2 industry-pricing">
          <div class="reveal">
            <ul class="price-list">
            <li><div class="pl-name">WhatsApp and enquiry assistant<small>Replies drafted from your prices and diary, on WhatsApp and your website. Then from <span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span>/mo to keep it running (3-month minimum, then month to month)</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Lots of customer email (20+ a day)? Inbox Assistant<small>Routine email replies drafted for your team. <span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span> setup + <span data-zar="2950">R2,950</span>/mo, with a <span data-zar="1500">R1,500</span> deposit to start, refunded in full if it doesn&rsquo;t save 5 hours a week</small></div><span class="price"><small>setup</small><span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Add a website<small>Your full menu, hours, map and WhatsApp ordering</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span></span></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:.8rem">40% deposit, the rest at go-live. It drafts replies to your real messages before it goes live, and you can stop after any stage.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="industry-side">
          <div class="card card--tint reveal">
            <h3>Not sure it&rsquo;s worth it?</h3>
            <p>That&rsquo;s what the free call is for. Tell us roughly how many messages and calls you get. We&rsquo;ll tell you honestly whether AI would save real hours, and if not, we&rsquo;ll say so.</p>
            <p style="margin-top:.6rem">Only a few messages a day? We&rsquo;ll say so on the call. WhatsApp Business quick replies and an away message may be all you need, and they&rsquo;re free.</p>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Prices are starting points for typical restaurants. Your quote is fixed before we begin. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing">Full price list &rarr;</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="card card--tint reveal friday">
            <h3>The Friday test</h3>
            <p>This Friday at 19:30, ask a friend to WhatsApp you &ldquo;Table for 4 at 8?&rdquo; and time how long the reply takes. No tech needed.</p>
            <p class="small" style="margin-top:.6rem"><a class="inline-link" href="#" data-wa-text="Hi Re-Charge, I tried the Friday test. Our reply took this many minutes: " data-contact="whatsapp" data-track="friday-test-wa" hidden>Tell us how long it took</a></p>
          </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2 id="howTitle">From first call to answered messages.</h2></div>
        <ol class="steps steps--4 reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Free 30-minute call</h3><p>You tell us what comes in and what eats your day. We say honestly whether AI fits.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>Fixed quote</h3><p>Exactly what it will do and what it costs. Nothing starts until you&rsquo;ve said yes.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>Tested on real messages</h3><p>It drafts replies to your real enquiries first, so you see it working before it goes live.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Running, and measured</h3><p>We look after it and send you the time it saved each month.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions restaurants ask</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Can it take bookings properly?</summary><p>Yes: it offers times from your booking rules and passes anything unusual to a person. If you use Dineplan, ResDiary or a paper diary, it works alongside it: where it can&rsquo;t see your bookings, it holds the request and a person confirms.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Does it reply by itself, even mid-service?</summary><p>Only where you choose. It starts with drafts on your real messages so you can check it. Then the safe ones (hours, parking, the menu, a normal table inside your booking rules) can go out by themselves, day or night. Functions, big tables and complaints always wait for a person.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What if it gets a booking wrong?</summary><p>It never confirms a table it can&rsquo;t see as free. Anything it isn&rsquo;t sure of waits for a person.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>I have two branches.</summary><p>One assistant can handle both and send each booking to the right branch. The quote covers both.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do I keep my WhatsApp number?</summary><p>Yes. It works on your existing WhatsApp Business number, and staff can still read and reply on the phone.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Does it charge commission?</summary><p>No. It&rsquo;s a fixed price, not a cut of your orders or bookings.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Who will we deal with?</summary><p>A small studio: the person on your free call builds it and answers your messages, with no call centre or hand-offs. It&rsquo;s documented and runs in accounts you own, so any developer can pick it up.</p></details>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1.2rem">More in the <a class="inline-link" href="pricing#faq">general FAQ</a>. Also for: <a class="inline-link" href="for-accountants">Accounting & professional firms</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-salons">Salons</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-plumbers">Plumbers & trades</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-cleaners">Cleaning services</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">For restaurants</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Find out what Friday night is costing you.</h2>
        <p>A free 30-minute call, phone or video, at a time that isn&rsquo;t service. You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-restaurants-book-end">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <p class="cta__alt">Rather we phone you? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-call-open>Pick a time</button> &middot; Prefer to write? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us in two lines</button></p>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
